msgid ""
"They were kept when it was uninstalled: its saves, settings and options "
"come back with it. Start fresh: they stay kept, for later."
msgstr ""
"Byly ponechány při odinstalaci: její uložené hry, nastavení a možnosti se "
"vrátí s ní. Začít znovu: zůstanou ponechány na později."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7495
msgid "Start fresh"
msgstr "Začít znovu"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7495
msgid "Put them back"
msgstr "Vrátit je"

